; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Yalmog'iz kampir -- Baba Yaga -- who keeps her hut on chicken legs in the dark
; wood, stirring her cauldron. She made the spell, and the medallion, for the
; queen: see docs/plan/2026-10-01-campaign.md.
;
; A person, as the commander is: the engine's neutral side, no Body, Weight 0 so
; no floor draws her. What she says is her Npc block in data/story/kampir.duke.
;
; Her look is Inuciian's ("Baba Yaga's hut", CC BY 4.0, see CREDITS.md), written
; in the game's units (ModelScale 1) and facing as the KayKit people do. She
; moves by her own file's one clip, Idle -- her stirring -- not by the Humanoid
; set: her rig is her own, and the KayKit clips would move nothing on it.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Monster
  Name = BabaYaga
  DisplayName = Yalmog'iz kampir
  KindOf = [INFANTRY, SELECTABLE]
  Geometry = Cylinder
    Radius = 4
    Height = 11
  End
  VisionRange = 0
  MinDepth = 99
  Weight = 0
  Colour = 0x8A2A22
  Scale = 1.0
  Model = models/inuciian/people/baba_yaga.glb
  ModelScale = 1
  Facing = 90
  Idle = Idle
End
